      "title": "feat(limits): cap the burst",
      "body": "Cap the burst before the bucket runs dry.\n\n<!-- Generated with Claude Code -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\nThis is a bot summary that must go.\n\n## What changed\nThe bucket refills once a second.\n\n- [ ] update the docs\n- [x] run the tests\n\n- [ ] part of #412\n- [ ] see https://github.com/acme/app/issues/415\n\n<details><summary>logs <details>inner</details></summary>\nsecret log\n</details>\n\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/abc\">Open in Cursor</a>\n\n![diagram](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abc-123)\n![badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/build-passing)\n<img src=\"https://example.com/shot.png\" alt=\"the shot\">\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bare-one\n\nThe reviewer found a race in the refill path.\n\nThe reviewer found a race in the refill path.\n\nSee https://github.com/acme/app/pull/120 and widgets/lib#4.\nsrc/limits#3 is a path, and docs/guide#2 is a top-level directory.\n\nPart of #412. Refs #999. Part of #120.\n\n## Decisions\n\nWe went with a token bucket instead of a fixed window.\n\n## Open questions\n\nShould the burst reset at midnight?\n",
